<!-- About Intro Section -->
<section class="about-intro">
    <div class="container"> 
        <div class="nexus-section-header">
            <span class="nexus-section-badge">Haven Club And Resort</span>
            <h2 class="nexus-section-title">Our Story And Luxury Exploration</h2>
            <p class="nexus-section-desc">Where dimensional travel meets unparalleled hospitality</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="about-image">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566073771259-6a8506099945?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2070&q=80" alt="Haven Resort">
            </div>
            <div class="about-content">
                <p>Founded in 2022, Haven Club & Resort Private Limited is revolutionizing the travel landscape with a focus on personalized service and exceptional hospitality. Our guiding principle, "Discover the world with us!", reflects our commitment to crafting unforgettable experiences for our guests while raising the bar in the industry.</p>
                
                <p>At Haven Club & Resort, we present our clients with an extensive selection of both domestic and international destinations. Our resort offerings range from breathtaking mountain retreats to peaceful beachfront getaways, and from captivating desert landscapes to serene lakeside escapes.</p>
                
                <p>Recognizing the significance of value in today's economy, we strive to deliver packages that offer outstanding value for money, ensuring our customers enjoy every moment of their holiday adventures.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

